/api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/assets/487285279","id":487285279,"node_id":"RA_kwDOPBIzzs4dC2If","name":"Advancely-v1.6.1-macOS-Universal.zip","label":null,"uploader":{"login":"LNXSeus","id":163330291,"node_id":"U_kgDOCbw48w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163330291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus","html_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-zip-compressed","state":"uploaded","size":137051171,"digest":"sha256:926d686222458b24b1e3c40b750e392725d84c31bfdfd9fd038eeb75ece85fc1","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-07-23T14:38:23Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T14:39:52Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/download/v1.6.1/Advancely-v1.6.1-macOS-Universal.zip"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/assets/487286807","id":487286807,"node_id":"RA_kwDOPBIzzs4dC2gX","name":"Advancely-v1.6.1-Windows.zip","label":null,"uploader":{"login":"LNXSeus","id":163330291,"node_id":"U_kgDOCbw48w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163330291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus","html_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LNXSeus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-zip-compressed","state":"uploaded","size":131938518,"digest":"sha256:372ae8c6d0be34d7309974b001e4091ccfee04b8685067819a2c604c8a1e5f9f","download_count":26,"created_at":"2026-07-23T14:39:51Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T14:41:16Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely/releases/download/v1.6.1/Advancely-v1.6.1-Windows.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/tarball/v1.6.1","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LNXSeus/Advancely/zipball/v1.6.1","body":"## I'm sure most of you have seen [Zesskyo's All Advancements Video](https://youtu.be/r18CnnPyTG4) and the neatly compact advancement progress graphic he used. So upon Zesskyo's request I've now implemented a new **Compact Overlay Mode** into Advancely and it might just be the best overlay ever!\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img width=\"290\" height=\"384\" alt=\"Overlay\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dcf099e1-3bd2-4621-8376-4533745a59ce\" />\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n### The Compact Overlay Mode\r\n\r\n#### Row 1 Icons\r\n- Optionally criteria/sub-stats can now cycle above the main panel (similar to the `Page` overlay mode).\r\n- Added lots of customization with icon size, horizontal spacing, cycle interval etc.\r\n\r\n#### Panel\r\n- A compact panel (with a new default background texture) shows the advancements/achievements count while all other goal types cycle in place on a single label.\r\n- Configure exactly which goal types/counts cycle.\r\n- If a specific player is selected during a coop session a player face appears in the bottom-right of the panel. Size and position can also be adjusted within the coop tab, when this overlay mode is used.\r\n- Full control over spacing, padding, fonts, sizing and so on.\r\n\r\n#### Pop-out stack\r\n- Goals popup from below the panel as they complete.\r\n- Choose exactly which goals pop and if they should also show up on partial progress or only on completion.\r\n- Manual-completion indicators: `[o]`/`[x]` in front of anything completable manually (x means checked off manually) and `[a]` when an auto-link completes a goal in the stack; these indicators can also be turned off.\r\n- When `All Players` are selected during a coop session, the pop-out stack will display the player face of the player that made progress.\r\n- Fine-grained control over spacing, font, ...\r\n\r\n### Other Overlay Improvements\r\n- Force the overlay into also showing template-hidden goals, for any mode.\r\n- The `Page` overlay mode always repeats until all goals of one row fit the width of the overlay from then on they clear like the auto-freeze of the scrolling belt mode.\r\n\r\n### Fixes\r\n- Cumulative live Hermes syncing during coop, no longer double-counts stat-based multi-stage goal stages.\r\n- Imports can now replace existing templates, and pressing ENTER no longer skips the warnings.\r\n- Disabled template count rescan during `Visual Layout Editor`, to prevent unnecessary read operations.\r\n- When dragging items in the `Visual Layout Editor` it only syncs the ones actually being dragged.\r\n\r\n### Additions\r\n- Added/updated `all_advancements` and `all_advancements` `_categorical` templates for `1.12`, `1.16.1`, `1.16.2`, `1.17`, `1.18`, `1.19`, `1.21.11`, `26.1`, `26.2` and `26.3`, plus a new 3D Wither Skeleton model and an updated 26.2 nether wastes texture. **Massive Shoutout to [ScrambledMC](https://www.twitch.tv/scrambledmc) for his amazing work on the categorical templates.**\r\n- Reordered `1.16` `all_advancements` `_coop` criteria for the overlay to be more consistent.\r\n- The Advancely window now says **LNXS' Advancely** instead of just **Advancely**.\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n> Find more info on the [tracker main page](https://github.com/LNXSeus/Advancely)!\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n# Thank you [diggitydingdong](https://www.youtube.com/@diggitydingdong) for your massive contribution!\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1397\" height=\"263\" alt=\"Supporters_Screen_Overlay_v1 6 1\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/08b7f5f5-00d4-447e-9cfd-0bab0d27d5f9\" />\r\n\r\n-----\r\n\r\n## *[Donations](https://streamlabs.com/lnxseus/tip) are always welcome\\! Make sure to mention `Advancely` in the donation message.*\r\n\r\nEnjoy the update\\!"}